    {
      "id": "nd45p_ewX-kfIuX33_saO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1315.0190685109856,
      "y": 657.4969173648567,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1998445569,
      "version": 75,
      "versionNonce": 1309813391,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771600316929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "暂时不用纠结于各个行业的细节，\n可以先尝试标准的模式去分析行业",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "暂时不用纠结于各个行业的细节，\n可以先尝试标准的模式去分析行业",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LQkYHML7UgIKN0U2ACIbF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.122827128264,
      "y": -618.2160573857244,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 258173839,
      "version": 315,
      "versionNonce": 1385569185,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "黄仁勋",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "黄仁勋",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ingv6m9GJpe_y7VN8uKJH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.122826648782,
      "y": 1087.8134838936207,
      "width": 1980,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1861425327,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 1198784385,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.超级努力。醒着的时候都在工作\n2.吸引很棒的人\n3.撇除噪音，专注于产品和服务\n很多公司很愚蠢，将钱花到不能改进产品的地方。特斯拉从不花钱做广告。把钱用于研发制造和设计，尽力把产品做的更好。如果不能，请停止这些尝试。\n4.不要随大流\n应当将事物归结到最根本的甄真理上，从根本出发进行推理。这能让你很好地判断，某个想法是否真的行得通，而不是别人说可行就可行，说不行就不行。当然不是所有事情都这样做，在创新的时候这样做是最好的思维方式。\n5.趁着年轻，勇于尝试。勇于冒险。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.超级努力。醒着的时候都在工作\n2.吸引很棒的人\n3.撇除噪音，专注于产品和服务\n很多公司很愚蠢，将钱花到不能改进产品的地方。特斯拉从不花钱做广告。把钱用于研发制造和设计，尽力把产品做的更好。如果不能，请停止这些尝试。\n4.不要随大流\n应当将事物归结到最根本的甄真理上，从根本出发进行推理。这能让你很好地判断，某个想法是否真的行得通，而不是别人说可行就可行，说不行就不行。当然不是所有事情都这样做，在创新的时候这样做是最好的思维方式。\n5.趁着年轻，勇于尝试。勇于冒险。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CFf4j2bouTLR43gh-_Uy5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.1228272090402,
      "y": 1051.0523669578906,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Z",
