      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "思考什么能改变世界，如果别人还没有做，可以去尝试",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "思考什么能改变世界，如果别人还没有做，可以去尝试",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Qsm-y-biAPIM0evpaynwt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.1228268402765,
      "y": -415.77129815384285,
      "width": 704.4597778320312,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1417266753,
      "version": 224,
      "versionNonce": 1601094433,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1993年的一款3D video game带来了需求(一种CPU无法满足的需求)：加速计算",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1993年的一款3D video game带来了需求(一种CPU无法满足的需求)：加速计算",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xwy8ToB4oNUUczWWQ21IY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.1228273614752,
      "y": -384.4754918034279,
      "width": 684.8399658203125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2134665263,
      "version": 406,
      "versionNonce": 298563329,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "此时设想未来会有一个巨大的video game的市场，这就是加速计算的应用场景",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "此时设想未来会有一个巨大的video game的市场，这就是加速计算的应用场景",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "U4ywyZL4xiHHJt_PH3N8E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2730.4174260689992,
      "y": -415.77129758160174,
      "width": 231,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2056992289,
      "version": 129,
      "versionNonce": 2015309537,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Accelerated computing",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Accelerated computing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9gNtIEDNXGcNfgivV8KrP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.1228274149773,
      "y": -349.4922843886982,
      "width": 207,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 664415873,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 1492691649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "crypto and mining：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "crypto and mining：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q7UXaAneDxTKvDVu7qXdq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2221.1228270518563,
      "y": -349.4922841739534,
      "width": 1204.159912109375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 605947009,
      "version": 158,
      "versionNonce": 2096605857,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "挖矿的数学难题（主要是哈希运算）需要不断重复尝试大量的随机数，直到找到正确答案，获得数字资产，GPU就成为了挖矿的主力设备",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "挖矿的数学难题（主要是哈希运算）需要不断重复尝试大量的随机数，直到找到正确答案，获得数字资产，GPU就成为了挖矿的主力设备",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M7wA-dNd-lx0DZU13d9EV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.1228267845363,
      "y": -311.86042533395505,
      "width": 33,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1153096353,
      "version": 154,
      "versionNonce": 1825287809,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AI:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ayFmByqQjteHp-SucSVci",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2056.4440059350973,
      "y": -311.8604253080947,
      "width": 525.4199829101562,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1659411777,
      "version": 161,
      "versionNonce": 1865692769,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI的进步 = 算法（大脑） + 数据（知识） + 算力（肌肉）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AI的进步 = 算法（大脑） + 数据（知识） + 算力（肌肉）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bXSvywj31FAwCxXXYYuA3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2056.4440063216553,
      "y": -283.21326992982574,
      "width": 791.7799682617188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1234542049,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 1191232065,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "特别是深度学习，生成token，核心就是海量的矩阵乘法，正是“小学生军团”最擅长的工作",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "特别是深度学习，生成token，核心就是海量的矩阵乘法，正是“小学生军团”最擅长的工作",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ybf8gmzuG7cgrizSrMhCs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2056.4440057546426,
      "y": -252.564555088347,
      "width": 524.1599731445312,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1823553921,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 823185953,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GPU的强大，一半靠硬件的肌肉，另一半则靠软件的灵魂。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GPU的强大，一半靠硬件的肌肉，另一半则靠软件的灵魂。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ikpBaAQd2eITjusJXCyb6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2464.179905468958,
      "y": -221.91584010860595,
      "width": 672.0999755859375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eaddd7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b50",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 256029601,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 575923713,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771607120845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CUDA可以理解为一种让开发者能直接指挥“小学生军团”的通用语言和工具集",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CUDA可以理解为一种让开发者能直接指挥“小学生军团”的通用语言和工具集",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
