      "text": "运行环境/API：CUDA(这是核心！它让开发者可以直接用 C++/Python 指挥 GPU 里成千上万的核心)。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "运行环境/API：CUDA(这是核心！它让开发者可以直接用 C++/Python 指挥 GPU 里成千上万的核心)。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mkSfA7VZE0I-xinEaqyb_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3809.7454457069357,
      "y": 733.0347980097974,
      "width": 726,
